{"reviewId": "902937897_81X0anfK2", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "关于价格，我看过一个说法，就是货币与商品数量以及消费之间的关联。如果增长依赖于投资，代表商品数量不变，消费不变，货币增长 ，开始通胀。这就会导致滞涨，大约三个库存周期后，就开始通缩。一切经济周期就是集体人类对于商品需求价格总和与已发行货币之间的差距产生的社会经济影响。\n什么时候会到经济上行周期，就是装修，20年一轮换，现代装修大约25-28年一轮换。在2004-2008买房的人数比较多，所以大约2029年-2035年开始复苏。", "bookVersion": 0, "abstract": "由于新的技术发明对劳动生产率的提升作用在繁荣的高潮期开始变弱，增长更多依赖于投资，从而造成价格上涨", "range": "8289-8338", "reviewId": "902937897_81X0anfK2", "userVid": 902937897, "topics": [], "createTime": 1753593827, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 6, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 902937897, "name": "阿智🏮🏮", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/tfrzZpyb5afrhgLibOD5WhEqat5OxAO6s15F5ibQ9FQhzJycdQNlXBR5CLFUZ5cHX0hyWjyFiczTZg/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M1-0-30", "desc": "连续阅读", "title": "连续阅读", "levelIndex": 30}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 60, "likes": [{"userVid": 918186993, "name": "asdfghjk", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0028-N8ZNgukEjzWamK7GbBe1kf8/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "asdfghjk", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "且看", "reviewId": "902937897_81X0anfK2", "commentId": "902937897_81X0anfK2_c447537194_8asIx99qt", "userVid": 44